It's so popular,

595
00:24:26,039 --> 00:24:27,599
yet there's not even a tourist center.

596
00:24:27,960 --> 00:24:29,000
Oh no,

597
00:24:29,599 --> 00:24:31,200
it's really like survival on a deserted island.

598
00:24:31,319 --> 00:24:32,759
I want to go home.

599
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:34,000
Me too.

600
00:24:42,799 --> 00:24:43,480
Oh, no.

601
00:24:44,160 --> 00:24:45,400
This is not Baisha Island.

602
00:24:48,680 --> 00:24:49,559
No way.

603
00:24:49,960 --> 00:24:51,440
I bought the ticket to Baisha Island.

604
00:24:51,759 --> 00:24:52,880
How could it be?

605
00:24:53,480 --> 00:24:54,440
Come and see.

606
00:25:01,319 --> 00:25:02,279
Look.

607
00:25:02,279 --> 00:25:03,400
This is Baisha Island.

608
00:25:03,400 --> 00:25:04,680
It's pronounced differently.

609
00:25:05,119 --> 00:25:06,839
We're going to Baisha Island.

610
00:25:06,839 --> 00:25:07,920
Baisha means white sand.

611
00:25:16,160 --> 00:25:16,920
Oh, no.

612
00:25:17,960 --> 00:25:18,920
I didn't see it clearly.

613
00:25:19,279 --> 00:25:20,880
There's no boat back.

614
00:25:24,920 --> 00:25:25,759
I'm sorry.

615
00:25:25,759 --> 00:25:27,160
I got you into this.

616
00:25:30,519 --> 00:25:31,759
Where are you going, Fu Binyan?

617
00:25:33,119 --> 00:25:34,160
We have no choice.

618
00:25:34,160 --> 00:25:35,400
Let's find a place to stay.

619
00:25:35,720 --> 00:25:37,880
We can't stay here until tomorrow.

620
00:25:37,880 --> 00:25:39,079
You're right.

621
00:25:39,079 --> 00:25:40,039
Since we're here,

622
00:25:40,039 --> 00:25:41,079
let's take a stroll around.

623
00:25:41,319 --> 00:25:42,240
Maybe there's more fun

624
00:25:42,240 --> 00:25:43,480
in the hidden map.

625
00:25:43,480 --> 00:25:44,200
Well said.

626
00:25:44,200 --> 00:25:44,680
Let's go.

627
00:25:44,680 --> 00:25:45,279
Go.

628
00:25:45,279 --> 00:25:45,920
Let's go.
